PROJECT CONTEXT (DATA + SEEDING)
════════════════════════════════════
- SQLite is the source of truth.
- Halo 3 MLG games are seeded via:
    npx ts-node seed-mlg-halo3.ts
Core files:
- squad_a.txt → fixed 4-player team
- squad_b.txt → fixed 4-player team
- pros.txt → pool of pro players

Seeding semantics:
- “Fixed vs Fixed” → squad_a vs squad_b only
- “Fixed vs Random” → fixed squad vs NEW random 4-player opponent from pros.txt each game
- “Randomized every game” → no repeat opponent combinations across games
- Random opponents must NEVER include fixed squad members
- Game counts are HARD limits (never exceed)

Database rules:
- Never delete anything without explicit instruction.
- All deletes must be tightly scoped (game_id prefix/label/explicit criteria).
- Always show:
   • count BEFORE
   • planned change
   • expected count AFTER
- Prefer SELECT previews before DELETE.

